== Notes ==
*The 50% concealment granted by this spell causes half of all attacks that would normally hit to miss (reduced to one quarter against an opponent with [[blind fight]]ing). This effect is highly valued for its impact on survivability (and its longer duration than [[displacement]]).
* Due to a .2da bug, ''invisibility purge'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

